<title>LITHUANIA: C.BANK CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 18.</title>
<headline>C.BANK CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 18.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the following currency fixings for Tuesday,  March 18 on Monday. The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		    18.03.97     17.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.3936	 6.3740</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3628	 2.3447</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5790	 4.5529</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2428	 3.2317</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5167	 0.5170</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7907	 0.7855</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2952	 0.2931</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8770	 6.8711</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.7014	 0.7009</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2987	 1.2950</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas,  Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
